Well, this patch works! 
There are alse correct irq numbers again while probing
for devices... (instead of irq 0 or 15)

de0: <Digital 21040 Ethernet> port 0x10100-0x1017f mem
0x81000100-0x8100017f irq 5 at device 8.0 on pci0
de0: interrupting at ISA irq 5
de0: 21040 [10Mb/s] pass 2.4
de0: address 00:80:c8:0d:39:05

Thanks,

Martijn


